  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK-Serbia Science and Innovation Fellowship Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project addresses fragmentation in Serbia&#x2019;s science and innovation landscape by strengthening governance structures within national institutions and local innovation centres, as well as fostering collaboration between them. Improved governance is essential for unlocking the sector&#x2019;s full potential, enhancing transparency, accountability, and operational effectiveness. The initiative will engage key stakeholders, national and local government bodies, government-owned universities, science and technology parks (STPs), civil society, media, and businesses to co-design and adapt proven UK governance models that promote inclusive, transparent, and accountable systems. The project will also foster cross-sector dialogue and bridge-building, encouraging stakeholders to develop joint initiatives and strengthen societal cohesion.</narrative>
  </description>
